Package: lsmf
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: LSMF Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-dbus-next, policykit-1, systemd, libgl1, libegl1, libfontconfig1, libxkbcommon0, libxcb-cursor0
Description: Qt desktop and typed privileged helper for LSMF release testing
 Installs the unprivileged Qt desktop with a pinned PySide6 runtime and the
 fixed D-Bus, Polkit, systemd, manifest, and Python helper runtime. Installation
 does not enable hardening or start the helper.
